  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 250eb<br>\n<strong>Type:</strong> Armor Enhancement (Body Armor, SP 8 or lower)<br>\n<strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p>Choose one version when installed. Insulated: while the armor has at least 1 SP, when a single EMP effect would disable your cyberware, this enhancement is disabled instead, for the same duration.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Armor Enhancement rules: one Enhancement per piece of armor (armor worn on both body and head counts as one piece); not for cyberware armor (Skinweave, Subdermal Armor) or armor that's part of an ACPA or vehicle; SP limits use the armor's fully repaired SP; a Tech installs or removes one in 1 hour with no check; they don't count as Tech Upgrades for Upgrade Expertise. Armor Attachments have no limit per armor unless stated.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Armor &amp; Fashion &gt; Armor Enhancements &amp; Kits).</em></p>"
